sequenceDiagram
    participant C as CanvasElement
    participant T as LineTool
    participant D as Document
    participant H as CommandHistory
    participant S as Scene

    Note over C: MouseDown
    C->>T: onMouseDown
    T->>T: beginDraft()
    T-->>C: 重畫
    loop 拖曳中
        C->>T: onMouseMove
        T->>T: 更新 Draft
        T-->>C: 重畫
    end
    Note over C: MouseUp
    C->>T: onMouseUp
    T->>T: commitDraft()
    T-->>C: AddObjectAction
    C->>D: addObject()
    D->>H: execute(cmd)
    H->>S: cmd.execute()
    C->>C: 重畫
